# Agent personas

Follow `docs/team.md`. Product shape is `docs/product.md`. Before building a slice of the portrait, pick **one** persona and read its file. Do not blend roles in one pass.

| Job | Persona |
|-----|---------|
| Scope, allow/deny, ship/block | `docs/personas/charter-editor.md` |
| Find and cite official series | Launch `source-librarian` (`.cursor/agents/source-librarian.md`) |
| States, UTs, districts, boundary changes | `docs/personas/geography-steward.md` |
| Fetch/parse into `data/` | `docs/personas/ingest-engineer.md` |
| Definitions, breaks, lags, disagreement | `docs/personas/methodologist.md` |
| Data vintage: generate / re-generate | `docs/personas/pipeline-engineer.md` |
| Model, refresh contract, serving | `docs/personas/platform-engineer.md` |
| Templates, render at a vintage, publish | `docs/personas/cms-engineer.md` |
| Citizen copy and charts | `docs/personas/portrait-editor.md` |
| Independent pass/block | Launch `trust-auditor` (`.cursor/agents/trust-auditor.md`) |

First crew: Charter Editor, Source Librarian, Methodologist. When a slice becomes a product, Platform Engineer sets the CMS and refresh contract before anyone builds a page. Trust Auditor before anything a citizen sees. Do not play Source Librarian or Trust Auditor in the parent.
